 dir="auto" style="--font-selector:SW50ZXItU2VtaUJvbGQ=;--framer-font-size:12px;--framer-font-weight:600;--framer-letter-spacing:-0.06em;--framer-text-alignment:center;--framer-text-color:rgb(82, 135, 144)" class="framer-text">Esprit d'équipe</p></div></div><div class="framer-1hscnvf"><div class="framer-6tfdxr" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="transform:none"><p dir="auto" style="--font-selector:SW50ZXItTGlnaHQ=;--framer-font-size:12px;--framer-font-weight:300;--framer-letter-spacing:-0.06em;--framer-text-alignment:center;--framer-text-color:rgb(82, 135, 144)" class="framer-text">Une posture collaborative, aux côtés des équipes terrain comme des directions, pour avancer ensemble vers des solutions durables.</p></div></div></div><div class="framer-ux2lv2" data-border="true"><div class="framer-da95ki"><div data-framer-component-type="SVG" parentsize="0" _constraints="[object Object]" rotation="0" shadows class="framer-c7i0j6" aria-hidden="true" style="image-rendering:pixelated;flex-shrink:0;background-size:100% 100%;background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22 xmlns:xlink=%22http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink%22 viewBox=%220 0 15.143 17.993%22 overflow=%22visible%22><path d=%22M 8.506 17.993 L 8.227 17.993 L 6.961 16.843 L 6.914 17.537 C 6.902 17.697 6.687 17.875 6.529 17.872 C 5.942 17.862 6.258 16.751 6.394 15.886 L 6.213 15.246 L 5.666 15.679 C 6.025 16.675 5.615 18.101 4.977 17.834 C 4.437 17.608 5.282 16.941 5.019 16.208 L 4.354 16.996 C 4.217 17.158 3.981 17.208 3.82 17.079 C 3.245 16.623 4.961 15.273 5.743 14.683 L 5.928 14.49 C 5.958 14.458 5.818 14.33 5.775 14.339 L 4.507 14.566 C 4.146 15.366 3.324 16.422 2.908 15.966 C 2.516 15.537 3.257 15.336 3.599 14.705 C 2.941 14.79 2.373 14.882 1.729 15.048 C 1.505 15.106 1.277 15.01 1.224 14.79 C 1.191 14.658 1.32 14.386 1.492 14.343 C 2.989 13.972 4.44 13.894 5.942 13.531 C 6.199 13.469 6.549 13.251 6.631 13.028 C 7.245 11.348 4.703 9.867 3.191 9.157 C 2.021 9.6